mh2lm: AppleARMBacklight drives the panel by DCS 0x51 (0111)

CoreBrightness (backboardd) finds an IOService with backlight-control = true
that conforms to AppleARMBacklight, reads IODisplayParameters.brightness and
sets {brightness, FadePeriod} through setProperties. The 0110 one-shot
sweetdcs test becomes sweet_display_brightness_set(), serialised by a mutex
and disabled after three failed writes. Boot-arg sweetbacklight=0 leaves the
service out.

